# NOTE: public/frames/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The 600-frame JPEG ladder is
# what makes this project runnable with Node alone — no Blender, no build step.
# If you would rather keep the repository small, ignore public/frames/ and
# regenerate with blender/bonsai_growth.py (~68 minutes on an Intel Xe iGPU).
